  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;color:#00f\"><strong>摘要</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用 mixin 修復了新版 <a style=\"color:#9cf\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a>&nbsp;的格擋間距問題。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:36px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">說明</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\">不知您是否注意到，在新版 Epic Fight 中，格擋（Parry）能力產生了間距異常，導致在面對高頻攻擊時無法正常格擋，本模組即為修復此問題而設計。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:36px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">安裝</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#9cf\">您需要：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#9cf\"><a style=\"color:#9cf\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge（新版）</a></span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#9cf\">只需下載上述區塊中的模組與相依性檔案，並與本模組一同安裝即可。</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
